/FT /Btn
/Ff 65536
/H /N
/Rect [81.414 570.411 528.402 742.404]
/Subtype /Widget
/T (tooltip zref@0)
/TU (Table outlining tasks in order picking, categorised under human factors, task phases, and outcomes. The human factors listed are perceptual, cognitive, physical, and psychosocial. Task phases include setup, travel, search, and pick. Examples of tasks are perceiving setup operations \(perceptual\), processing documents \(cognitive\), carrying items \(physical\), and addressing motivation or workload \(psychosocial\). Outcomes of order picking are performance \(time\), quality \(pick errors\), and worker health.)
/Type /Annot
>>
