/T (tooltip zref@3)
/TU (Flow chart presenting the process of research design including a design research science approach. The flowchart includes a definition of the research problem consisting of manufacturing warehouses, human-centricity and digital technologies. It describes the research questions of the study: \(1\) What components characterise information generation and task analysis of human-centered order picking when applying AI-enabled vision systems in manufacturing warehouses? \(2\) How can AI-enabled vision systems, focussed on enhancing human-centered order picking, address privacy concerns in manufacturing warehouses? The flow chart finalises by presenting the context, intervention, mechanism and outcome logic of the study.)
/Type /Annot
